Mon Oct  5 21:55:19 UTC 2026 - tokajer <tokajer@tokajer.at>

- Initial package: system tweaks for gaming
  * sysctl defaults (max_map_count, swappiness, dirty bytes, ...)
  * zram swap via zram-generator, zswap disabled via tmpfiles.d
  * udev rules for I/O scheduler, audio and SATA power management
  * Load ntsync module at boot for Wine/Proton
  * PipeWire default quantum 512
